no-smaller = Kept as it was, since it is no smaller written again
unverified = Kept as it was, since the copy did not read back as it went in
changed-meanwhile = Kept as it was, since the file changed while it was written again
halted = Kept as it was, since it was stopped before it was done
not-a-flac = Kept as it was, since it is not a FLAC file
vaulted = Kept as it was, since its song is kept in the vault
cut-by-sheet = Kept as it was, since a cue sheet cuts it into songs
outside-the-library = Kept as it was, since it is under no folder of the library
head-unread = Kept as it was, since its FLAC header could not be read
id3-after-the-audio = Kept as it was, since it carries an ID3v1 tag after the sound
ape-after-the-audio = Kept as it was, since it carries an APE tag after the sound
beyond-the-encoder = Kept as it was, since its { $rate } kHz, { $bits } bit sound is beyond what the encoder writes; choose a lower quality to keep
tied-to-the-samples = Kept as it was, since its { $block } block names places in the sound that a new rate or depth would move
disagrees-with-its-digest = Kept as it was, since its sound does not match the checksum it carries
wider-than-its-depth = Kept as it was, since its samples are wider than the depth it declares
turns-partway = Kept as it was, since its sound changes shape partway through
undecodable = Kept as it was, since its sound could not be decoded
silent = Kept as it was, since it holds no sound
held-under-other-names = Kept as it was, since it is linked under other names, which would keep the old copy
attributes-not-carried = Kept as it was, since the copy could not be given the file's owner, permissions or attributes
